WEBVTT

00:05:25.031 --> 00:05:30.140
biz o'zga sayyoraliklarning 
televiktorinalarini eshitmadik.

00:05:30.140 --> 00:05:34.456
Bu bir necha yuz yorug'lik yili
radiusidagi

00:05:34.456 --> 00:05:36.733
sayyoralarda xuddi bizdek rivojlangan

00:05:36.733 --> 00:05:40.995
sivilizatsiyalar mavjud
emasligini ko'rsatadi.

00:05:40.995 --> 00:05:43.045
O'zga sayyoraliklarning
o'g'irlab ketishidan

00:05:43.045 --> 00:05:50.030
sug'urtalanishning joriy etilishi 
mutlaqo xavfsiz ish ko'rinadi.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:53.029
Bu meni muhim savollarning so'ngisiga 
javob berishga undaydi:

00:05:53.029 --> 00:05:56.050
Insoniyatning kelajagi qanday?

00:05:56.050 --> 00:06:00.028
Agar biz galaktikadagi yagona 
aqlli mavjudotlar bo'lsak,